# Pong Game

A simple two-player Pong game built using Python Turtle.

## Features
- Two-player gameplay
- Keyboard controls
- Score tracking
- Ball and paddle collision
- Sound effects
- Game over at 5 points

## Technologies
- Python
- Turtle
- Tkinter
- Winsound

## Controls
Player A:
W - Up
S - Down

Player B:
↑ - Up
↓ - Down